OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FWarning: Article may contain
OL,8,Fdistressing details
OL,10,FA funeral director who lied to his
OL,11,Fclients over the cremation of their
OL,12,Floved ones has been told how his
OL,13,Factions left them feeling betrayed and
OL,14,Ftraumatised.
OL,16,FRobert Bush sat largely emotionless in
OL,17,Fthe dock on Monday in the first of up
OL,18,Fto five days of sentencing for 67
OL,19,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,20,Fdecent burial, fraud and theft.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
