FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FThe multitude of charges relates to
OL,8,Fthe discovery of human bodies and
OL,9,Fashes at the Legacy Independent
OL,10,FFuneral Directors premises on Hessle
OL,11,FRoad in Hull back in March 2024.
OL,13,FLegacy owner Bush, 48, had been on
OL,14,Fholiday in America at the time, and
OL,15,Fhad sent another undertaker to the
OL,16,Fpremises to assist with a body
OL,17,Frecovery.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FConcerns prompted the undertaker to
OL,8,Fpersuade another casual worker present
OL,9,Fat the site to look inside, where they
OL,10,Fhappened across what prosecutor
OL,11,FChristopher Paxton KC described as
OL,12,Fbeing "like a horror scene".
OL,14,FWhat followed was a lengthy police
OL,15,Finvestigation, culminating in Bush
OL,16,Fpleading guilty to the charges in
OL,17,FApril.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FHull Crown Court heard from more than
OL,8,Fa dozen of the victims' loved ones on
OL,9,FMonday in a series of harrowing
OL,10,Fstatements, in which they described
OL,11,Ffeeling betrayed, sickened and deeply
OL,12,Faffected by Bush's crimes.
OL,14,FSome of those victims told how they
OL,15,Fhad committed to having their loved
OL,16,Fones' ashes put into jewellery, or
OL,17,Fscattered in sentimental places, only
OL,18,Fto later learn those remains had been
OL,19,Fof an unknown stranger.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FRea Burton's grandfather David Burton,
OL,8,F75, was among those recovered from the
OL,9,FLegacy premises after the family had
OL,10,Fbeen given back ashes.
OL,12,FIn a statement read out in court, she
OL,13,Fsaid: "Robert Bush deceived us. He had
OL,14,Fabandoned and hidden our loved one for
OL,15,Fmonths and handed us a stranger's
OL,16,Fashes with a smile on his face."
OL,18,FRaymond Dagnell, 64, another victim of
OL,19,FBush's, had requested his ashes be
OL,20,Fscattered at sea, due to his
OL,21,Fbackground as a fisherman in Hull.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FHis sister Christina George told the
OL,8,Fcourt through tears that her family
OL,9,Fhad spread his ashes at sea at
OL,10,FBridlington, only to later learn his
OL,11,Fbody had still been at the Legacy
OL,12,Fpremises. She described feeling guilt
OL,13,Fthat the person whose ashes they
OL,14,Fspread might not have been someone who
OL,15,Fliked the water.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FFacing him on Monday, she said: "I
OL,8,Fwonder if Robert Bush ever thinks
OL,9,Fabout the trauma he has caused
OL,10,Fpeople... He has caused trauma that
OL,11,Fwill be with us forever and never go
OL,12,Faway. We just have to learn to live
OL,13,Fwith it."
OL,15,FBush is charged with 30 counts of
OL,16,Fpreventing a lawful and decent burial
OL,17,Fand a further 30 counts of fraud
OL,18,Frelating to those burials.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785257280
OL,3,CDisgraced funeral director 'handed
OL,4,Cstrangers' ashes to families with a
OL,5,Csmile'
OL,7,FHe also faces four counts of fraud
OL,8,Frelating to the ashes of unborn
OL,9,Ffoetuses, two further counts of fraud
OL,10,Fand a count of theft relating to
OL,11,Fcharity donations which were never
OL,12,Freceived.
OL,14,FThe sentencing, heard before Mr
OL,15,FJustice Hilliard, is due to last for
OL,16,Ffive days.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/8
